3731323737","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能3","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"狼魂与我同在！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060656773A0351000183134353731323737.mp3"},{"id":"065306773A0361000183137363530363931","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能3","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"听我号令！","hasText":true,"duration":1.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065306773A0361000183137363530363931.mp3"},{"id":"065056773A0371000183339353233343738","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"离开草丛（满能量）","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"就是现在！","hasText":true,"duration":1.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065056773A0371000183339353233343738.mp3"},{"id":"064876773A0361000183137393935323335","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"进入草丛3S播放1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"注意隐蔽。","hasText":true,"duration":1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/064876773A0361000183137393935323335.mp3"},{"id":"069896773A0381000183734353132383033","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"离开草丛（满能量）","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"时机到了！","hasText":true,"duration":1.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/069896773A0381000183734353132383033.mp3"},{"id":"063906773A0391000183233323839323534","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"相遇-王昭君-友","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"苍：击碎深渊，北荒的悲剧便不会重演。","hasText":true,"duration":3.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/063906773A0391000183233323839323534.mp3"},{"id":"067826773A0371000183131313936313137","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"进入草丛3S播放2","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"制胜一击，值得耐心等待。","hasText":true,"duration":2.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067826773A0371000183131313936313137.mp3"},{"id":"060176773A0381000183539303434363239","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"相遇-王昭君-友","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"苍：那就以利箭贯穿贪婪，以信念重铸欲望。","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060176773A0381000183539303434363239.mp3"},{"id":"065966773A0341000183931313936343739","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能1射箭","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"穿透你的信念！","hasText":true,"duration":1.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065966773A0341000183931313936343739.mp3"},{"id":"060426773A0351000183138303536343531","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能2_有人踩中陷阱2","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"一览无余！","hasText":true,"duration":1.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060426773A0351000183138303536343531.mp3"},{"id":"062626773A0341000183635343236343935","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能2","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"陷阱，是武器的延续！","hasText":true,"duration":2.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/062626773A0341000183635343236343935.mp3"},{"id":"063176773A0341000183137383632323339","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能2","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"狼魂不死，附着其中！","hasText":true,"duration":2.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/063176773A0341000183137383632323339.mp3"},{"id":"060976773A0351000183133323431343331","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能3","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"去吧，揪出草丛里的懦夫！","hasText":true,"duration":2.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060976773A0351000183133323431343331.mp3"},{"id":"067406773A0351000183731353731393530","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能2_有人踩中陷阱1","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"哼，策略！","hasText":true,"duration":2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067406773A0351000183731353731393530.mp3"},{"id":"069386773A0331000183131333639333237","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能1射箭","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"贯穿始终！","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/069386773A0331000183131333639333237.mp3"},{"id":"067196773A0341000183137363532383830","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能2","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"下一个踩中的会是谁呢？","hasText":true,"duration":2.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067196773A0341000183137363532383830.mp3"},{"id":"063076773A0311000183136343433373930","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"击杀主宰","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"击穿宿命，我为主宰！","hasText":true,"duration":2.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/063076773A0311000183136343433373930.mp3"},{"id":"068246773A0311000183334363038353137","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"败方MVP","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"信念不死，不过重来一次。","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068246773A0311000183334363038353137.mp3"},{"id":"067166773A0331000183136333236393836","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"购买装备-破晓","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"破晓出现在最黑暗的夜空。","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067166773A0331000183136333236393836.mp3"},{"id":"065046773A0321000183333353932323334","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"待机语音1","category":"待机","seq":null,"text":"当我成为我们，速度与射程共存。","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065046773A0321000183333353932323334.mp3"},{"id":"068976773A0331000183137393731353431","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"技能1射箭","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"信念为箭！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068976773A0331000183137393731353431.mp3"},{"id":"063046773A0321000183538373336303936","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"击杀暴君","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"狂暴的力量总伴随着灾祸，就像深渊里的太阳那样。","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/063046773A0321000183538373336303936.mp3"},{"id":"068566773A0321000183131303337373436","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"购买装备_铁剑匕首","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"不同的武器，令狼群更强。","hasText":true,"duration":3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068566773A0321000183131303337373436.mp3"},{"id":"060636773A0321000183931353539363632","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"购买装备-无尽之刃","category":"装备","seq":null,"text":"总得有人为无尽的宿命，改写一个结局。","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060636773A0321000183931353539363632.mp3"},{"id":"062296773A0301000183932343138373335","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"回城动画","category":"回城","seq":null,"text":"对头狼而言，撤退与进攻同样重要。","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/062296773A0301000183932343138373335.mp3"},{"id":"060246773A0301000183135383033343835","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"挑衅1","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"苍狼后裔推测，你们的祖先恐怕不是斑鸠就是野兔。","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/060246773A0301000183135383033343835.mp3"},{"id":"064626773A0301000183935313533383036","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"击杀语音3","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"属于我们的胜利！","hasText":true,"duration":1.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/064626773A0301000183935313533383036.mp3"},{"id":"061536773A0301000183236393830333831","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"残血回城","category":"回城","seq":null,"text":"撤退！","hasText":true,"duration":0.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061536773A0301000183236393830333831.mp3"},{"id":"068226773A02F1000183738383134323833","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"开场语音","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"失去信念的部族，失去未来。","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068226773A02F1000183738383134323833.mp3"},{"id":"061026773A0311000183135373738363535","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"胜方MVP","category":"MVP","seq":null,"text":"众志成城，胜利属于我们！","hasText":true,"duration":3.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061026773A0311000183135373738363535.mp3"},{"id":"065546773A0311000183131333535393333","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"挑衅2","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"你最好真有本事干掉我，懦夫。","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065546773A0311000183131333535393333.mp3"},{"id":"061546773A02F1000183531373936383337","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"击杀语音2","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"背叛者的下场！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061546773A02F1000183531373936383337.mp3"},{"id":"069716773A02F1000183131383134323832","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"击杀语音1","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"凡人皆有一死！","hasText":true,"duration":1.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/069716773A02F1000183131383134323832.mp3"},{"id":"061396773A02E1000183532323939343733","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"复活语音1","category":"复活","seq":null,"text":"杀不死的狼群，将更加强大。","hasText":true,"duration":3.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061396773A02E1000183532323939343733.mp3"},{"id":"061386773A02E1000183133383235373332","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"死亡语音2","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"狼群从不放弃……","hasText":true,"duration":3.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061386773A02E1000183133383235373332.mp3"},{"id":"067476773A02D1000183136343030363638","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音11","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"原来我们抬头仰望的，从不是同一片星空。","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067476773A02D1000183136343030363638.mp3"},{"id":"065206773A02D1000183133383637313733","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音10","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"哼，选择堕入深渊么？","hasText":true,"duration":3.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065206773A02D1000183133383637313733.mp3"},{"id":"069786773A02D1000183931313538333730","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音12","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"说服不了，那就征服。","hasText":true,"duration":3.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/069786773A02D1000183931313538333730.mp3"},{"id":"065376773A02E1000183135363233393837","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"死亡语音1","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"狼血始终传承。","hasText":true,"duration":5.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065376773A02E1000183135363233393837.mp3"},{"id":"064186773A02D1000183131333835323934","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音9","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"苍狼说，狼的魂魄会附着在最锋利的牙上。","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/064186773A02D1000183131333835323934.mp3"},{"id":"061256773A02F1000183136343336333031","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"复活语音2","category":"复活","seq":null,"text":"我从深渊归来。","hasText":true,"duration":1.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061256773A02F1000183136343336333031.mp3"},{"id":"068036773A02B1000183132383938363333","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"强者，或者自以为强者！","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068036773A02B1000183132383938363333.mp3"},{"id":"064896773A02C1000183130353733373136","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"不要因畏惧而低头，生命是不死不休。","hasText":true,"duration":5.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/064896773A02C1000183130353733373136.mp3"},{"id":"068646773A02C1000183137383630303537","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"狼群深知团结的意义，只有人类，从未放弃私心。","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/068646773A02C1000183137383630303537.mp3"},{"id":"065656773A02C1000183133383435353532","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音8","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我见过深渊的黑暗，人心远比深渊更加深邃。","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/065656773A02C1000183133383435353532.mp3"},{"id":"062686773A02B1000183830343138363132","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"没什么是一发利箭不能解决的。如果有，那就两发。","hasText":true,"duration":5.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/062686773A02B1000183830343138363132.mp3"},{"id":"066886773A02C1000183137373039353333","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"吝惜性命的不是狼，是狗。","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/066886773A02C1000183137373039353333.mp3"},{"id":"061166773A02B1000183931363636383638","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"当你凝视深渊的时候，深渊也在凝视你。","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/061166773A02B1000183931363636383638.mp3"},{"id":"069956773A02B1000183637313732383739","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"雄鹰不为暴风折翼，狼群不因长夜畏惧。","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/069956773A02B1000183637313732383739.mp3"},{"id":"067436773A02A1000183131363638313437","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"大厅出现2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"驰骋草原，碎裂深渊！","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/067436773A02A1000183131363638313437.mp3"},{"id":"063326773A02A1000183931313531373933","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"大厅出现5","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"为信念而生的人，无所畏惧！","hasText":true,"duration":11.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/063326773A02A1000183931313531373933.mp3"},{"id":"062426773A0291000183435343531343832","heroId":"246","skinId":"489","skinName":"苍狼末裔","title":"大厅出现1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"与狼共舞！","hasText":true,"duration":10.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/246/062426773A0291000183435343531343832.mp3"}]